Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:04.60,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yuan Yue gets a win in Beijing{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N袁悦在北京赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:08.56,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she reaches the second round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她晋级了第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.56,TL,,0,0,0,,袁悦连赢最后{\fs78}3{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.70,TL,,0,0,0,,终于把胜利留在主场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.00,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}30{\fs68}号下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.83,TL,,0,0,0,,中网女单首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.23,TL,,0,0,0,,外卡出战的袁悦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:21.52,TL,,0,0,0,,击败奥利尼科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:25.10,TL,,0,0,0,,比分看着干脆 过程却没那么轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:30.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 盘点 袁悦在底线接住相持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.31,TL,,0,0,0,,正反手连续衔接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.89,TL,,0,0,0,,这场她{\fs78}8{\fs68}个接发局 拿下{\fs78}6{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:37.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}次破发机会 兑现{\fs78}6{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:40.66,TL,,0,0,0,,发球有反复 接发的压力还在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.64,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yuan secures the opening set{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N袁悦拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.80,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with yet another break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次破掉对手发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:52.74,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘一度{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.38,TL,,0,0,0,,又被追到三平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:57.05,TL,,0,0,0,,现在{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 对手的局点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.65,TL,,0,0,0,,袁悦要先接住相持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:00.93,TL,,0,0,0,,短球来了 再抢上去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:04.57,TL,,0,0,0,,到了网前 比的就是落点和手感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.06,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's brilliant from Yuan Yue.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N袁悦这一球太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.46,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a touch!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么细腻的手感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.32,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's great control.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N控制得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:17.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68} 赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.79,TL,,0,0,0,,轮到自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:27.24,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That will feel good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场胜利让人舒心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:30.64,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yuan Yue gets a win in Beijing{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N袁悦在北京赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:34.60,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she reaches the second round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她晋级了第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:36.37,TL,,0,0,0,,从查尔斯顿到北京
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:39.43,TL,,0,0,0,,终于又赢下一场巡回赛正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:41.29,TL,,0,0,0,,三平之后连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.66,TL,,0,0,0,,袁悦把笑容留在主场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:46.09,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮 安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:48.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她还能继续向前吗？
